node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# The built bundle is not committed -- `cargo xtask ui` produces it and `cargo xtask dist`
# requires it. The directory itself is, with nothing in it: `rust-embed` resolves its
# folder at compile time, so `cargo build` on a tree that has never run `pnpm build` needs
# the path to exist. It then embeds nothing, the management UI route says so in one
# sentence, and the gate that would have caught it stays the gate rather than becoming a
# confusing linker error.
build/*
!build/.gitkeep
